connection is up to us, whether it weakens as a result of reduced physical contact or whether we intentionally find ways to strengthen it as a decision that is in our hands to make. A few years ago, two friends of mine, Sunny and Dave, were at a retreat in Colorado Springs, and these are two dear friends of mine who I love seeing, but I don't get to see them nearly as often as I want. And as we were walking around the lake, we said, gosh, wouldn't it be great if we could see each other more often?

69
