that more opportunities for meeting up would come about. So we made a pact at the end of that walk. We said once a month, we are gonna video conference for two hours. And during those two hours, we're gonna be honest and open with each other about what we're going through. That sure we're gonna have hours, we're gonna be honest and open with each other about what we're going through, that sure we're gonna have fun, we're gonna catch up,

