00:42:53.000 --> 00:43:31.000
through difficult times, whatever came. And that's what Sunny and Dave have done for me, and I'm deeply grateful for it. One of the ideas you talk about is how if you want to feel more connected to others, the best thing to do might not be to ask why others are not reaching out to you, but ask how you can be of service to others. And there certainly have been leaders like Martin Luther King Jr. and Mahatma Gandhi who have talked about this idea that service in some ways can be an antidote to loneliness. Can you talk about this idea of a vague? Absolutely. This was one of the most powerful lessons that I learned,

